{"unit_id":"tag:0EYU:statement","translation":"光滑（Smooth）基变换（base change）<OWNARGEND_0001>考虑概形（schemes）的笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagram）<MATH_0001>，其中<MATH_0002>光滑（smooth），<MATH_0003>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）。则<MATH_0004>对任意<MATH_0005>以及任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0006>成立，这个层位于<MATH_0007>上，其所有几何点（geometric points）处的茎（stalks）都是挠（torsion）的，且挠元素的阶在<MATH_0008>上可逆（invertible）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"定理名称"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"定理名称"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"图的对象"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"图的条件"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"态射性质"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"态射条件"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"态射条件"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点","context":"茎的指标"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"系数条件"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","context":"系数条件"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"挠元素阶的条件"}],"notes":[]}
